  },
  "h0dn.readme.ritos": {
   "valor": "| Hubble ratio, H0DN × BG1 (2026-11-12) | `NOT_FALSIFIED`, under the published error model: 6.11σ against the null and −0.61σ from the K law; beside it, free Cepheids give 4.38σ, below 5 | the creditation (validity, not creditation); a retrodiction without fit; the test is not blind |\n| Hubble ratio, Phase 9 V2 | `NOT_FALSIFIED_POWERED` (`REGISTRO_FASE9_V2.md`) | β in nature at 5σ: not reached by that test |",
   "fonte": "handoff",
